sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Publishing and confirming a cast
accDescr: An app key signs a cast in the browser. Signed bytes go through the client service and read node to validators. The committed result returns before the client confirms.
box rgb(248,245,255) Your browser
participant B as Browser
end
box rgb(239,248,244) Your node host
participant C as Client service
participant S as Read node
end
box rgb(255,249,238) Farcaster network
participant V as Validators
end
Note over B: App key signs the cast.<br/>Private key stays here.
B->>C: 1 · Signed cast over HTTP(S)
C->>S: 2 · Submit signed bytes
S->>V: 3 · Forward message
V-->>S: 4 · Committed block
S-->>C: 5 · Matching result
C-->>B: 6 · Confirmed
